  "label": "Colonialism and Film",
  "description": "The role of film in preserving and transmitting the history and experiences of colonized peoples, often in opposition to colonial narratives that sought to erase or distort their histories. The meme critiques the idea of forgetting colonialism by implying that such film is essential for understanding and addressing the legacy of colonialism.",
